msgctxt "224"
msgid "Oh, perfect timing, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"I need to go pick up some supplies. Think you could look after the place "
"while I'm gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "(Guess I could...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Sure, I'll do it. Don't know much about bartending, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"No problem. There's nobody in here right now anyway, and with a big guy like"
" you behind the counter, I don't have to worry about security."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Got it. Don't be long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Wonderful. I'll be back soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Sorry. I'm not cut out for bartending."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Really? I think you'd make a fine bartender."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Well, let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Until you help out, I won't be able to make any food for our customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Ouch. So thanks to me, your customers are gonna starve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
